<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Imbaaqo Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbaaqo Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc2">Imbaaqo Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc3">Im</para>
  <para style="mt1">Imbaaqo Tinbite</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafay nam7u kifiletan shaakettana dandayees; ha maxaafan koyro nam7u shemppoti nabe Imbaaqoy Xoossara haasayda haasayata qonccisees. Imbaaqoy Yuhudan pirday geellattidayssassinne mooro oosoy daridayssas eqeteththa qaala sissides; Baabiloone asay Yuhuda deraa qaxxayana giza zaaro Xoossi izas immides. Gido attiin Imbaaqoy Baabiloone asay Yuhuda deraappe aadhdhida nagaranchcha gidida gishshas Yuhuda derey istta kushen waani qaxxayettanee? giidi Godaa oychchides. GODAY iza oyshaas Baabiloone asay sinththafe bantta woden qaxxayettana giza zaaro immides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafas wurseththa shemppoy Imbaaqoy Godaa bonchcho gishshassinne iza maata gishshas shiishshida galata woosa bessees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbaaqo magananne Godaa zaaro <char style="ior"><ref loc="HAB 1:1-2:4">1:1—2:4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nagaranchchata bolla yaana pirda <char style="ior"><ref loc="HAB 2:5-20">2:5-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imbaaqo woosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HAB 3:1-19">3:1-19</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1" />Nabe Imbaaqos ajjuutan qonccida kiitay hayssafe kaallizayssa.<verse eid="HAB 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbaaqos Koyro Zuuzunth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2" />GODAWU! Ne tana maaddana mala ta nena xeygishin ne ayde gakkanaas siyikkii? «Qohoy darides» gaada ta waassishin ne ayde gakkanaas ashshikii? <verse eid="HAB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3" />Ne tana aazas qohoy darshin bessay? Hayssa mala gene oosoy oosettishin ne waana co7u gaada xeellay? Mooroynne makkallay ta sinththan dees. Ooshshinne palamay biitta bolla darides. <verse eid="HAB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4" />Hessa gishshas wogay leppides; tuma pirday deenna; tuma pirday geellattana mala iitati xillota un7eththeettes.<verse eid="HAB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossafe Imettida Zaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5" />«Inttes yootettiinkka ammanontta inttena ta intte paxa dishin issi miish ooththana gishshas ane ha7i asaa xeellite; be7idinne daro malalettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:41">Hawa 13:41</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HAB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6" />Baas gidontta keeththanne dizaso oykkanaas biitta ubbaa worajjiza shemppo iitatanne pilatata Baabiloone dere asaa tani denththana. <verse eid="HAB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7" />Isttika babisizaytanne daganththizayta; istta pirdaynne bonchchoy isttafe kezana. <verse eid="HAB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8" />Istta paray maaheppeka pilata; omarsa kana suytetappeka menxe iita; istta toga asaykka too pilatanne haahoppe yizayta. Baqqi ekkidi eleliza golle kafo mala piradhdheettes. <verse eid="HAB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9" />Wurikka genes gixxi kezida; istta ola asay bazzo biitta carko mala gede sinththe hordofees. Di7ettidayta ace mala shiishshees. <verse eid="HAB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10" />Kawota leqqees; dere haarizayta qidhi kaa7ees; ola miixa ubbaa leqqees; biitta issiso shiishshi guuppidi katamata baas oykkees. <verse eid="HAB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11" />Hessafe guye gote carko mala pitti ekki bees; heyti ba wolqqa baas xoossa kessida nagaranchchata» gees.<verse eid="HAB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbaaqos Nam7anththo Zuuzunth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12" />Abeet GODAWU! Ne mernaasofe daasa gidikkii? Ta Geeshshawu, ta Xoossawu, neni naagiza gishshas nuni hayqqoko; GODAWU istta pirdana mala ne istta shuumadasa. Zaallazoo! Istti nuna qaxxayana mala ne isttas maata immadasa. <verse eid="HAB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13" />Ne ayfeti iita xeellontta mala keehi geeshsha; neni qoho co7u ga xeellanaas dandayakka; histtiin as baleththizayta aazas co7u gadii? He asati baappe keehi xilliza asata dhayssishin ne aazas co7u gay? <verse eid="HAB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14" />Neni asaa abba giddon diza mole malanne GODAY isttas baynda abba giddon diza medheteththa mala ooththadasa. <verse eid="HAB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15" />Iita morkkey istta wursika manxakora oykki kessana; izi istta gitenkka oykki goochchana; ba woththizason istta shiishshi woththana; hessankka ufayettidi hashshu gaana. <verse eid="HAB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16" />Hessankka shempidi diza gishshassinne izi miza qumay modhdho gidida gishshas ba oykkida gitezas yarsho yarshees; qasseka ba shiishshizasozas exaane cuwasees. <verse eid="HAB 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17" />Histtiin izi wontiin wontiin pacey baynda ba gite yeggi yeggi mole oykkiza mala derezakka mishay baynda wodhanaas bessizee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2">2Kawo 24:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1" />Tani naage naagizason eqqana; miixa gimbe bolla kezada heen takkana. Ta oyshaas GODAY ay zaaro immanakko ta dizason daada iza naagana.<verse eid="HAB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbaaqo Oyshaas Goday Immida Zaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2" />Xoossi Imbaaqos,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 2:2">«Waayisontta nababettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:2">nees ajjuutan qonccidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:2">saleeda bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:2">lo7eththa wooca xaafa.<verse eid="HAB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3" />Ne ajjuutazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">baas imettida wode naagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">izikka wurseththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">gishshas yootees,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">wordotenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">Gam7ana misatikkoka naaga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">izi tumappe yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:3">mulekka gam7enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:37">Ib 10:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4" />«Hekko izi otorettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:4">iza amoy suure gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:4">xillo asi gidikko ammanon dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Oro 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:11">Gala 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:38">Ib 10:38</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5" />Dureteththi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hayssan dureteth gizayssa issi issi birsheththati woyne ushshu geettes.</char></note> as baleththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">otoranchchas mulekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">shemppoy deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">izi duufo mala yora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">wodhiza hayqo malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">kalo erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">dere ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">shiishsheessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:5">di7i ekki bees.<verse eid="HAB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6" />Histtiin hessa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">asa bolla qidheninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">kadhen asay, ‹Ba kaysi ekkida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">shaqaceza baas shiishshizaades,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">genen duretizaades aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">Hessaththo ayde gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">shiishshanee?›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:6">gi iza bolla miiccennee?<verse eid="HAB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7" />Ne acon yeggida asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:7">ne qoppontta ne bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:7">dendettennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:7">Istti beeggidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:7">nena daganththettenee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:7">Hessafe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:7">ne istta kushen kundana.<verse eid="HAB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8" />Ne daro dere miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:8">bonqqida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:8">hankko bonqqettonttayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:8">nena bonqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:8">ne asa suuth gussadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:8">deraa, katamanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:8">izan dizayta wursa dhayssadasa.<verse eid="HAB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9" />«Wordora baleththi ekkida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:9">miishshan baas daana keeth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:9">keexxizaadessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:9">ba morkke kusheppe attanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:9">ba keeth dhoqqasohon keexxizaades</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:9">aayye ana!<verse eid="HAB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10" />Daro asa shemppoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:10">dhayana mala qachchadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:10">ne keeththa bollanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:10">ne bolla dhayssizaaz ehadasa.<verse eid="HAB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11" />Gimbe giddon shuchchi waassees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:11">giddon goda eqqida miththatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:11">izas zaaro immeettes.<verse eid="HAB 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12" />«Suuth gussidinne iita ooththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:12">katama essizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="HAB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13" />Asa oosoy ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:13">taman xuugettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:13">dereykka mela daaburana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:13">GODAY Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:13">Wolqqama Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:13">ubbaa woththibeennee?<verse eid="HAB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14" />Abbay kumiza mala biittay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:14">GODAA gitateth eron kumana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:9">Isa 11:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15" />«Asa kalloteth beyanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:15">ba laggeta ushshu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:15">ushshizaadessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:15">istti uyidi maththottana gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:15">woyne ushshu duuqqizaades</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:15">aayye ana!<verse eid="HAB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16" />Neni bonchcho gishshas yeellatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">hessika ha7i taray nees gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">gishshas uyada gandigara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">ne kallotta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">GODAA ushachcha kushen diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">hanqo xuu7ay ne bolla simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">kase nees diza bonchchoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:16">kawushshateththan laammana.<verse eid="HAB 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17" />Ne Libaanoose bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">ooththida geney</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">nena mittana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">neni medosata dhayssidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">zaari nena daganththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">hessika ne asa suuth gussida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">dereta, katamatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">isttan dizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:17">ne ubbaa dhayssida gishshassa.<verse eid="HAB 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18" />«Asa kushey massi giigsida eeqanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">wordo haasayza misles</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">ay go7ay dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">Histtiin iza ooththidaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">barkka ba ooson ammanettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">isttika haasayanaas dandayontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:18">eeqa ooththiza gishshassa.<verse eid="HAB 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19" />Miththaa, ‹Ne beegga!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">Shemppoy baynda shuchchaaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">‹Ne denda!› gizaades aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">Tumukka izi tamaarsana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">Hekko izi bollara worqqaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">biran tiyettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:19">izas shemppoyka deenna.<verse eid="HAB 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20" />GODAY gidikko ba Geeshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:20">keeththan dees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:20">Biitta bolla diza derey wurikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 2:20">iza sinththan co7u go» gides.<verse eid="HAB 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Imbaaqo Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1" />Nabe Imbaaqoy yeththan shiishshida woossa.<verse eid="HAB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2" />Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">Ta ne goobateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">gishshas siyadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">GODAWU ne oosoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">tana yashissides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">neni ne ooso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">nu woden ooraththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">ne oosoti nu wodenkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">erettana mala ooththarkkii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">Hanqo wodekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:2">maaroteth qopparkkii!<verse eid="HAB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3" />Xoossi Temaaneppe Geeshshayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:3">Paaraane zuma bollafe yides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:3">Iza bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:3">salo kammi oykkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:3">Iza galataykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:3">biitta bolla kumides.<verse eid="HAB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4" />Iza poo7oy awa arshe poo7o mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:4">awa xalqqey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:4">iza kusheppe kezides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:4">iza wolqqayka heen qotettides.<verse eid="HAB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5" />Iita hargey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:5">izappe sinththara bides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:5">hada hayqoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:5">iza geedo kaallides.<verse eid="HAB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6" />Izi eqqiin biittay qaaxxides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:6">izi xeellidi asaa kokkorisides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:6">Mernaas diza zumati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:6">laaleteth piski gida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:6">Beniisofe diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:6">zumatikka woddida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:6">Iza ogey mernaassa.<verse eid="HAB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7" />Tophphiya dunkaaneti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:7">metotettishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:7">Midiyaameta duussasoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:7">bul7akettishin ta beyadis.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tophphiya geetettiza qaalay laappun tammu eranchchata birsheththan gidishin Ibraaweta qaalan Kuushan gees; Kuushinne Kuushey dumma dumma hara qaalata; Tophphiyay Ibraaweta qaalan Kuushe geetettees attiin Kuushan gidenna. Kuushan geetettizayti Eedoome matan de7iza Arabe zaretakko.</char></note><verse eid="HAB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8" />GODAWU! Ne haaththata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">hanqettadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">Ne hanqoy haaththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">pulttota bolla dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">Neni ne paratanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">xooniza para-gaareta toggada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">kaaleththida wode abba bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:8">hanqettadii?<verse eid="HAB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9" />Neni ne wondafe giigsadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:9">yiishshay nees yaana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:9">azazadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:9">biitta phalqada haath kessadasa.<verse eid="HAB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10" />Zumati nena be7idi mannida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:10">Haaththaa dambalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:10">aadhdhi bides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:10">abbay ceeqettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:10">abbaa dambalakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:10">pude denththides.<verse eid="HAB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11" />Ne pirisa yeddida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:11">ne yiishshatappenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:11">xolqettiza ne toora poo7oppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:11">dendidayssan arsheynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:11">aginay ba dizason eqqi attida.<verse eid="HAB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12" />Neni biitta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:12">hanqon simerettadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:12">deretakka hanqon yedhdhadasa.<verse eid="HAB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13" />Neni ne dere ashshanaasinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:13">ne tiydaade ashshanaas kezadasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:13">iita dere kaaleththizaade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:13">liiqisadasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:13">hu7eppe toho xugunth gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:13">kallo ashshadasa.<verse eid="HAB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14" />Gote carko mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:14">nuna laallanaas yidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:14">aykkoy baynda manqoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:14">geemara mittanaas amottizayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:14">olanchchata halaqa gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:14">iza tooran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:14">iza zaara caddadasa.<verse eid="HAB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15" />Neni abba ne paratan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:15">yedhisiza woden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:15">ciimma abbay qaaxxees.<verse eid="HAB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16" />Tani siyadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">ta wozinaykka dagammides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">Iza giirssafe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">ta metershay kokkorides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">Babon taas maracey qaaxxides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">Taas gulbatey kokkorides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">gidikkoka nu bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">worajjiza dereza bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">metoy yaana gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:16">ta gencca naagays.<verse eid="HAB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17" />Balase geetettiza miththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">ayfontta aggikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">woyne miththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">ayfey beettontta aggiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">wogara miththika ayfontta aggiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">goshsha gadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">kath immontta aggiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">Dorsi yiren dontta aggikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:17">Miizi zedhen dontta aggikokka<verse eid="HAB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18" />Tani ta GODAAN ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:18">ta izan attida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:18">Xoossan ufayettana.<verse eid="HAB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19" />GODA Ta Xoossay taas wolqqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:19">ta tohota izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:19">genessa toho mala minththo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:19">izi tana dhoqqasohora hemeththana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:19">Yexxizayta kaaleththizaades</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HAB 3:19">yeththa miishshan yexettida mazamure.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:34">2Same 22:34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:33">Maza 18:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3" />
</usx>